# HOST checks against the laptop backend (http://127.0.0.1:8010, local SQLite), after the emulator run
$ GET /reports?device_id=ecu-demo-01
{"event_id": "ecu-demo-01-1794775617-1", "device_id": "ecu-demo-01", "type": "pothole", "severity": "high", "detection_confidence": 0.95, "evaluation": "evaluated"}
$ POST /reports  (the same signed line again, as a retry after a lost answer)
201 {"status":"duplicate","ack":"stored","event_id":"ecu-demo-01-1794775617-1","device_id":"ecu-demo-01","stored_at":1794775635.3019571,"evaluation":"evaluated"}
$ POST /reports  (same line, one field changed: severity high -> low, signature kept)
401 {"detail":"signature does not verify with the registered key","code":"bad_signature","retryable":false}
